    "text": "I here by give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as mention by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the lands describe below for theconstruction of Kiththampahuwa Canal, Maintain the CanalBank and Construction of Service Road under a sub Projectof Metro Colombo Urban Development Project.",
